<ArticleLayout title="Building a Semantic Similarity Search API with FastAPI, Sentence-BERT, and PostgreSQL pgvector" description="Take a FastAPI and Sentence-BERT pgvector API beyond a demo: benchmark exact vs HNSW search, filtered recall, tenant isolation and end-to-end latency." eyebrow="pgvector architecture" published="2025-10-21" updated="2026-10-14" original ctaTitle="Is vector search slowing a production workload?" ctaDescription="Review recall, filters, latency and PostgreSQL resource use together before choosing an index or a larger database instance.">
